<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">25082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>One gas carrier passed through the Strait of Hormuz on Monday... a waterway that normally carries a fifth of the world's seaborne oil.</s> <s>Nobody has mined it and nobody has declared it closed — underwriters and shipowners have simply decided the transit can't be insured, which is how a chokepoint shuts without an announcement.</s> <s>The tracking firm Kpler says war-risk premiums and charterer refusal are doing the work a blockade would, and the cost lands first on Gulf and Asian importers, not on the treasury that set the pressure campaign in motion.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Venezuela's earthquake death toll has passed six thousand five hundred, with two hundred twenty-six thousand people recorded as having received medical care since June.</s> <s>Read those two numbers together and you get the shape of the disaster — a health system still absorbing a mass-casualty event weeks after the shaking stopped, as crush injuries, sanitation failure and the slow clearing of collapsed masonry keep killing.</s> <s>Every figure comes from Assembly Speaker Jorge Rodríguez, relayed by <sub alias="Tass">TASS</sub>, and there's no independent verification available — the government counting the dead is also the only source of the count.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan, Saudi Arabia and Turkey have signed a joint defence pact in Mecca, and almost nothing in its text is public.</s> <s>The absence is the story, because a defence agreement's entire value lies in its automaticity — one that obliges consultation is a communiqué, one that obliges response is a security guarantee, and only the text tells you which this is.</s> <s>Three of the largest Muslim-majority militaries aligning outside the American security architecture would be the most consequential shift in the ummah's strategic geography in years... but the parliaments of all three states weren't consulted, and neither were their publics.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two constables in Bahawalpur, Muhammad Khan and Aurangzeb, have been charged with murder after a man named Daud drowned at a canal bridge, allegedly beaten there while in their custody.</s> <s>A case like this is rare not because custodial death is rare but because the station that holds the body also controls the post-mortem, the evidence and the first information report — so a charge exists only when someone outside the police is willing to complain and survive doing it.</s> <s>Police say Daud jumped in while fleeing arrest, and in southern Punjab such prosecutions almost never reach conviction.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Washington struck Syria from its state-sponsor-of-terrorism list on Monday, ending forty-seven years of designation.</s> <s>That listing was the statutory hook for arms embargoes and export controls layered on top of it, so removing it converts Syria from an embargoed state into an eligible recipient of American weapons and export financing in a single administrative act.</s> <s>Congress still controls the separate Caesar Act penalties, and Syrians displaced by both the old government and the new one aren't part of the negotiation.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Beijing is drafting its own supply-chain and corporate due-diligence standards, and exporting them to the countries its firms operate in.</s> <s>Whoever writes a standard decides which audits count and which certifiers are accredited, which means controlling market access without a tariff or a treaty — the same lever Brussels has pulled for a decade.</s> <s>Manufacturers across Africa and South Asia now face two incompatible compliance regimes and the cost of satisfying both, and a country that adopts Chinese standards is far harder to decouple than one that merely trades with China.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two Ethiopian peacekeepers were killed and seven wounded in an ambush in South Sudan's Jonglei state.</s> <s>Losing the Pajut route doesn't shrink the UN mission's mandate — it shrinks its freedom of movement, which is what actually delivers civilian protection in one of the country's few outside-monitored corridors.</s> <s>Thirty-six such attacks are already logged this year, and the mandate on paper stays exactly the same.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Ontario's premier Doug Ford told Washington it won't get a grain of sand — a threat to cut the electricity his province sends directly to New York, Michigan and Minnesota.</s> <s>It follows fifty-percent American tariffs on twenty-eight billion dollars of Canadian exports that took effect Saturday after talks collapsed, with Ottawa answering dollar for dollar.</s> <s>Power exports have never been used this way between the two countries, and the grid doesn't have a diplomatic off-switch.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The rating agency <sub alias="S and P">S&amp;P</sub> says Europe's heatwaves now threaten insurers' earnings — nine thousand of the ten thousand six hundred fifty excess deaths in late June were people sixty-five and older.</s> <s>Heat has crossed from a weather story into a life-and-health underwriting story, meaning the financial system has begun pricing climate mortality directly rather than through flood and windstorm damage.</s> <s>An insurer facing a repriced risk raises premiums or withdraws, and both transfer the cost to the old, the ill and those without cooling — apply that same actuarial logic to the Gulf or the Sahel and cover simply becomes unbuyable.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A licensed Islamic bank in Ras Al Khaimah now offers Bitcoin trading inside its shariah-compliant platform.</s> <s>Scholars have divided for a decade over whether Bitcoin counts as māl, property with recognised value, and whether its volatility amounts to gharar — and a bank launching this means a shariah board has ruled, though the bank hasn't published its reasoning.</s> <s>What the institution adds is custody and a regulated counterparty, turning a bearer asset into a claim on somebody... which is precisely the inversion that makes the doctrinal argument possible.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India will privatise eleven airports in five deliberately mismatched bundles, pairing a profitable field with a loss-making one.</s> <s>The bundling is the whole design — the state is selling the right to earn at Varanasi alongside the obligation to serve Kangra, moving a public-service loss onto a private balance sheet with no subsidy line in the budget.</s> <s>Landing fees are the small part of airport revenue; retail, parking and fuel are the rest, so service at the small airports now depends on a fifty-year concession contract rather than a ministry's mandate.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan has opened bonded storage that lets foreign fuel sit tax-free on its soil, untaxed and foreign-owned until it's sold.</s> <s>It's an answer to the Hormuz shutdown that buys storage depth without buying the fuel — cheaper than a strategic reserve, but seizable only in a declared emergency.</s> <s>Brent's trading around ninety-five dollars, and Islamabad's betting the tanks fill before it needs them, God willing.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>England will post free self-sampling kits to women who've missed cervical screening — up to four million aren't up to date.</s> <s>The barrier was never the test's accuracy but attendance, and a clinic appointment demanding time off, transport and a physical examination filters out exactly the women at highest risk.</s> <s>What changed is technical: screening now looks for high-risk <sub alias="H P V">HPV</sub> <sub alias="D N A">DNA</sub> rather than abnormal cells under a microscope, and that works on a swab a woman collects herself — the one modality that doesn't need a clinician per patient, which matters far more where no screening programme exists at all.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The European Space Agency will adapt its Ariane six rocket to launch future Argonaut landers carrying a radioisotope power source.</s> <s>The lunar night lasts about fourteen Earth days, and no solar array or battery a lander can carry survives it, so anything meant to work for years at the Moon needs heat from decay rather than sunlight.</s> <s>Europe has depended on American plutonium and has been developing its own americium supply to escape that — this is a sovereignty story wearing an engineering costume, and nothing's flown yet.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Nanjing have identified the physical courier for something long observed but never explained — how children of obese mothers inherit metabolic dysfunction.</s> <s>Small extracellular vesicles, membrane-wrapped parcels of regulatory <sub alias="R N A">RNA</sub> that one tissue releases and another absorbs, rewrite a fetus's epigenome without altering a single gene sequence.</s> <s>Be exact about the limits: this is mouse and cell work with human relevance argued rather than demonstrated, and it matters most where obesity is rising fastest and trial data is thinnest.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The United States sanctioned Iranian nationals over critical-infrastructure attacks, days after Britain disclosed an intrusion at a small power plant.</s> <s>The word small carries the story — the compromised sites aren't flagship stations with security operations centres but minor generators and water utilities running old, internet-exposed control systems maintained by two people.</s> <s>Freezing a named individual's assets in a jurisdiction they never enter denies no capability at all; its real function is attribution, while thousands of unglamorous utilities stay inside the blast radius of a conflict they've no part in.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A former congressional staff director now lobbies for the weapons maker Anduril while advising a Navy panel that will recommend the very vessels it builds.</s> <s>A Bulletin of the Atomic Scientists study counts thirty-one former lawmakers and senior staff who left the armed services committees for industry since twenty fifteen, and the destination has shifted from Boeing to Silicon Valley.</s> <s>Defence startups can't win through the Pentagon's multi-year acquisition process, so they hire the people who know how to route around it — which is roughly how a firm reaches a sixty-one billion dollar valuation.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Cape Town sold public land to the data-centre operator Equinix for one hundred rand, after the facility was classified as a warehouse.</s> <s>Planning scrutiny attaches to land-use category, so that single reclassification skipped the water and power review a data centre would face in a drought-prone city.</s> <s>The Legal Resources Centre is challenging it in court, and the question of who gets the water when the dams fall stays unanswered.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>